@startuml
title RAG corpus and AutoRAG pipeline

hide empty description
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

RawExternalSources --> Extractors
Extractors --> ExtractedJsonl
ExtractedJsonl --> LLMNormalization
LLMNormalization --> MergedRules
MergedRules --> ExactDeduplication
ExactDeduplication --> QualityFilter
QualityFilter --> Validation
Validation --> ValidatedRules

ValidatedRules --> RuntimeExport
RuntimeExport --> RuntimeJsonl
RuntimeJsonl --> ViRAGRuntime

ValidatedRules --> AutoRAGExport
AutoRAGExport --> CorpusParquet
AutoRAGExport --> QAParquet
CorpusParquet --> TrainTestSplit
QAParquet --> TrainTestSplit

TrainTestSplit --> TrainParquet
TrainTestSplit --> TestParquet
TrainParquet --> AutoRAGValidate
TrainParquet --> AutoRAGEvaluateTrain
AutoRAGEvaluateTrain --> BestConfig
BestConfig --> AutoRAGEvaluateTest
TestParquet --> AutoRAGEvaluateTest
AutoRAGEvaluateTest --> AutoRAGSummary
BestConfig --> RuntimeConfig
RuntimeConfig --> ViRAGBenchmark

ExactDeduplication --> ManualEmbeddingDedup : optional manual step
ManualEmbeddingDedup --> QualityFilter

note right of QualityFilter
Removes short slogans, documentation noise,
NLV leakage, excessive repeated readability
clusters and source dominance.
end note

note right of TrainTestSplit
70/30 split prevents selecting retrieval
settings only on the same QA records used
for final validation.
end note
@enduml
